        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Great Wave"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(water)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nThe Great Flood gathers all nearby water and floods a mile burst. Any creature in the area must succeed at a 42 Reflex save or be moved up to 60 feet in a direction of the Great Flood's choice. The area remains flooded with 30-foot-deep water for 1 hour or until the Great Flood dies, then drains naturally."
            },
